    "x": 60,
    "y": 390,
    "width": 960,
    "height": 150,
    "z_index": 5,
    "content": "Our blenders forage rosemary from the hills behind the distillery and press blood oranges within hours of picking them from the grove.",
    "font_family": "Solstice Sans",
    "font_size": 28,
    "color": "rgba(250,240,225,1)",
    "text_align": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "para2",
    "type": "text",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 560,
    "width": 960,
    "height": 150,
    "z_index": 5,
    "content": "Nothing artificial ever touches the bottle. No syrups, no concentrates, no shortcuts, just slow infusions that take eleven days to finish.",
    "font_family": "Solstice Sans",
    "font_size": 28,
    "color": "rgba(250,240,225,1)",
    "text_align": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "para3",
    "type": "text",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 730,
    "width": 960,
    "height": 150,
    "z_index": 5,
    "content": "Each batch is numbered by hand and tasted by the whole team before it ships, which is why some weeks we simply release nothing at all.",
    "font_family": "Solstice Sans",
    "font_size": 28,
    "color": "rgba(250,240,225,1)",
    "text_align": "left"
   },
   {
    "id": "para4",
    "type": "text",
    "x": 60,
    "y": 900,
    "width": 960,
    "height": 150,
    "z_index": 5,
    "content": "Find us at farmers markets across the coast every Saturday morning, or order a mixed case online with free delivery on orders over forty.",
